{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03478",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.95,
      "end_seconds": 5.4,
      "duration_seconds": 4.45,
      "text": "Hi, is it okay to come in now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.2,
      "end_seconds": 10.85,
      "duration_seconds": 4.65,
      "text": "Okay, that's fine, sit down. Tell me why you came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.13,
      "end_seconds": 25.78,
      "duration_seconds": 13.65,
      "text": "hmm, you know, so the thing is, I've got a severe headache for days. I wasn't sure whether to come in at all, to be honest"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.84,
      "end_seconds": 30.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "how long has this been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.74,
      "end_seconds": 40.04,
      "duration_seconds": 8.3,
      "text": "Right, probably two days. Yeah. I'd rather know what's going on than keep guessing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 40.85,
      "end_seconds": 50.76,
      "duration_seconds": 9.91,
      "text": "So, tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 52.09,
      "end_seconds": 59.4,
      "duration_seconds": 7.31,
      "text": "I notice it more with lying down honestly, a few times a day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 60.13,
      "end_seconds": 62.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Right, any other symptoms with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.51,
      "end_seconds": 73.93,
      "duration_seconds": 9.42,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get double vision as well. The double vision? That's been for two days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 74.54,
      "end_seconds": 81.83,
      "duration_seconds": 7.29,
      "text": "Have you had a severe headache for days before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 83.76,
      "end_seconds": 89.13,
      "duration_seconds": 5.37,
      "text": "A bit, last winter. It settled by itself back then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.05,
      "end_seconds": 97.21,
      "duration_seconds": 6.16,
      "text": "Before we go further, any allergies? These questions might sound routine, but they matter."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.49,
      "end_seconds": 103.7,
      "duration_seconds": 5.21,
      "text": "I mean, no, I've never reacted to to anything"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.28,
      "end_seconds": 109.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "Alright, has anyone in your family had anything serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.16,
      "end_seconds": 114.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "my sister had breast cancer"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.72,
      "end_seconds": 125.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "do you have any chronic illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.93,
      "end_seconds": 135.74,
      "duration_seconds": 5.81,
      "text": "I mean, I've had gout for about a year now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 136.85,
      "end_seconds": 140.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "okay, do you follow any particular diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.58,
      "end_seconds": 149.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.27,
      "end_seconds": 156.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "Is there someone at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 158.18,
      "end_seconds": 162.43,
      "duration_seconds": 4.25,
      "text": "My husband and I live above the shop."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.74,
      "end_seconds": 166.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "What do you take on a normal day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 167.74,
      "end_seconds": 180.15,
      "duration_seconds": 12.41,
      "text": "I'm on allopurinol, 100 milligrams, once a day. I kept putting it off, which I know isn't sensible. Febuxostat I don't take anymore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.23,
      "end_seconds": 194.57,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "Did you get weakness on one side or head injury?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 198.62,
      "end_seconds": 202.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "No, none of those at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.1,
      "end_seconds": 206.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "have you had fever, by any chance?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 207.88,
      "end_seconds": 209.47,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "Nope, no fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.11,
      "end_seconds": 212.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "Is your chest okay generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 214.01,
      "end_seconds": 215.59,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.14,
      "end_seconds": 238.18,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "Let me get the readings out of the way."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.91,
      "end_seconds": 252.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "That's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 266.8,
      "end_seconds": 273.36,
      "duration_seconds": 6.56,
      "text": "Okay: heart rate 79, saturation 97 percent, blood pressure 146 over 91, temperature 36.9."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 274.72,
      "end_seconds": 279.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "Alright, over here please and I'll take a look."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.68,
      "end_seconds": 282.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "Tell me if that's sore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 298.54,
      "end_seconds": 302.83,
      "duration_seconds": 4.29,
      "text": "the optic discs look swollen and and you are drowsy"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 305.02,
      "end_seconds": 336.24,
      "duration_seconds": 31.22,
      "text": "Thank you, you can get dressed. Right, here's what I'm thinking. It fits best with possible cerebral venous thrombosis. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more. Another possibility is raised pressure in the head. So, to recap quickly. You've had a severe headache for days for two days, and no fever or weakness on one side."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 337.4,
      "end_seconds": 339.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "Mm, that's right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 343.7,
      "end_seconds": 364.89,
      "duration_seconds": 21.19,
      "text": "I want an MRI of the head done, that's for papilloedema. I want an urgent CT venogram done, that's for possible venous thrombosis. Stop the pill, you need an urgent scan and admission. If the symptoms get worse, or you feel really unwell, please come to the emergency department."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 365.98,
      "end_seconds": 370.53,
      "duration_seconds": 4.55,
      "text": "Okay, so I know what to watch for."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 371.91,
      "end_seconds": 379.86,
      "duration_seconds": 7.95,
      "text": "I'd like to see you again straight away is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 381.89,
      "end_seconds": 385.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "good, thanks, I'll see you then"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 387.25,
      "end_seconds": 388.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.43,
      "text": "goodbye for now"
    }
  ]
}